{"id": "2fcd674a-6bad-4214-826f-7c5336935639", "slug": "creator-course-mobile-screens", "title": "Creator Course Mobile Screens", "description": "Creator Course Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Creator Course Mobile Screens\"\ndescription: \"Creator Course Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF3B8D\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#767680\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#767680\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Creator Course Mobile Screens\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 36; favorites: 2; remixes: 1.\nTags: hero, section, cta, effect.\n## Overview\nCreator Course Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\n9:41 12:18 / 28:00 1x Creative Sprint A fast-paced course focused on generating, shaping, and refining ideas for creative projects, products, and content. By Daniel Reed 4.9 Lessons 14 Idea Flow 28 min 1 lesson Concept…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Creative Sprint; Lessons; AI for Creators; From Sketch to Vision; January 4-10.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF3B8D, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #8B5CF6, background #FFFFFF, surface #767680, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse -apple-system for display moments and -apple-system for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nUse subtle reveal and hover states only where they support the source hierarchy. Avoid adding motion that changes the layout character.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>iOS Music App UI Concept</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://images.unsplash.com\" />\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    :root{\n      --bg:#101014;\n      --phone:#0b0b0f;\n      --text:#f7f7fb;\n      --muted:rgba(247,247,251,.62);\n      --faint:rgba(247,247,251,.36);\n      --line:rgba(255,255,255,.11);\n      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,.10);\n      --glass-strong:rgba(255,255,255,.16);\n      --accent:#ff3b8d;\n      --accent2:#8b5cf6;\n      --orange:#ff9f0a;\n      --green:#30d158;\n    }\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      min-height:100vh;\n      color:var(--text);\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 12%, rgba(255,59,141,.24), transparent 32%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 86% 18%, rgba(139,92,246,.24), transparent 34%),\n        linear-gradient(135deg, #251a26, #5f5265 45%, #2a2730);\n      font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Display\", \"SF Pro Text\", Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n    }\n    .stage{\n      min-height:100vh;\n      padding:56px 32px;\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:center;\n      justify-content:center;\n      gap:48px;\n      overflow-x:auto;\n    }\n    .phone{\n      position:relative;\n      width:393px;\n      height:852px;\n      flex:0 0 auto;\n      overflow:hidden;\n      border-radius:52px;\n      background:var(--phone);\n      box-shadow:0 42px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.36), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n    }\n    .phone.small-drop{transform:translateY(44px)}\n    .phone.large-rise{transform:translateY(-28px)}\n    .island{\n      position:absolute;\n      z-index:50;\n      top:12px;\n      left:50%;\n      transform:translateX(-50%);\n      width:126px;\n      height:37px;\n      border-radius:999px;\n      background:#000;\n    }\n    .status{\n      position:absolute;\n      z-index:49;\n      top:0;\n      left:0;\n      right:0;\n      height:59px;\n      padding:17px 35px 0;\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:flex-start;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      font-size:15px;\n      font-weight:650;\n      letter-spacing:-.01em;\n    }\n    .status .sys{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:#fff}\n    .battery{width:25px;height:12px;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.82);border-radius:4px;padding:1.5px;position:relative}\n    .battery:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-4px;top:3px;width:2px;height:5px;border-radius:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}\n    .battery span{display:block;height:100%;width:72%;border-radius:2px;background:#fff}\n    .safe{\n      position:absolute;\n      inset:0;\n      padding:74px 20px 96px;\n    }\n    .topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}\n    .circle-btn{\n      width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:999px;color:var(--text);\n      display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:23px;\n      background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);\n      box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.1);\n      backdrop-filter:blur(28px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(28px);\n    }\n    .profile{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.2)}\n    .caption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:560;letter-spacing:.01em}\n    .large-title{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:34px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.045em;font-weight:750}\n    .subtle-card{\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.12),rgba(255,255,255,.055));\n      border:1px solid var(--line);\n      backdrop-filter:blur(32px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(32px);\n      box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12),0 18px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.22);\n    }\n    .search-pill{margin-top:22px;height:44px;border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;background:rgba(118,118,128,.22)}\n    .hero-album{position:relative;margin-top:22px;height:310px;border-radius:34px;overflow:hidden;background:#222}\n    .hero-album img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(1.05)}\n    .hero-album:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 35%,rgba(0,0,0,.72));}\n    .hero-copy{position:absolute;left:18px;right:18px;bottom:18px;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\n    .hero-copy h2{margin:0;font-size:29px;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.04em}.hero-copy p{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72)}\n    .play-btn{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;border:0;background:#fff;color:#050507;font-size:30px;display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}\n    .section-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:26px;margin-bottom:14px}.section-head h3{margin:0;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.025em}.section-head a{color:var(--accent);font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:650}\n    .row{min-height:68px;border-radius:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.055);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)}\n    .cover{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;object-fit:cover}.row-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.02em}.row-sub{margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.more{margin-left:auto;color:var(--faint);font-size:22px}\n    .tabbar{position:absolute;z-index:40;left:18px;right:18px;bottom:18px;height:72px;border-radius:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-around;background:rgba(22,22,26,.72);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12);backdrop-filter:blur(36px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(36px)}\n    .tab{width:62px;height:52px;border-radius:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:3px;font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}.tab iconify-icon{font-size:24px}.tab.active{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n    .home-indicator{position:absolute;z-index:60;left:50%;bottom:7px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:138px;height:5px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.78)}\n    .player-bg{position:absolute;inset:0}.player-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:blur(34px) saturate(1.35);transform:scale(1.2);opacity:.52}.player-bg:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(12,12,16,.36),#0b0b0f 75%)}\n    .artwork{position:relative;margin:52px auto 0;width:305px;height:305px;border-radius:38px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}.artwork img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}\n    .track{text-align:center;margin-top:30px}.track h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.035em}.track p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}\n    .progress{margin:32px 10px 0}.progress-line{height:6px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);position:relative}.progress-line span{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;height:100%;width:42%;border-radius:999px;background:#fff}.progress-line i{position:absolute;left:42%;top:50%;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.times{margin-top:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--faint);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}\n    .controls{margin:34px 6px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.controls button{border:0;background:transparent;color:#fff;width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:32px}.controls .main{width:78px;height:78px;background:#fff;color:#050507;font-size:42px;box-shadow:0 16px 38px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n    .volume{height:44px;margin:30px 8px 0;border-radius:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0 12px;background:rgba(118,118,128,.18);color:var(--muted)}.volume-line{height:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:999px;flex:1;position:relative}.volume-line span{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;height:100%;width:68%;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.82)}\n    .library-header{padding-top:8px}.chips{display:flex;gap:10px;margin:20px 0 0;overflow:hidden}.chip{height:36px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;background:rgba(118,118,128,.22);color:rgba(255,255,255,.72)}.chip.active{background:#fff;color:#0b0b0f}\n    .playlist-card{height:146px;border-radius:30px;margin-top:22px;padding:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 30%,rgba(255,59,141,.55),transparent 35%),linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.16),rgba(255,255,255,.06));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}.playlist-card h2{margin:0;font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.035em}.playlist-card p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.stack{position:absolute;right:18px;bottom:18px;display:flex}.stack img{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:18px;object-fit:cover;margin-left:-18px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #1c1720}\n    .mini-player{position:absolute;z-index:38;left:18px;right:18px;bottom:98px;height:64px;border-radius:24px;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:rgba(30,30,34,.78);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);backdrop-filter:blur(36px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(36px)}.mini-player img{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:16px;object-fit:cover}.mini-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.mini-sub{margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.mini-player button{margin-left:auto;border:0;background:#fff;color:#000;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:21px}\n    @media(max-width:900px){.stage{justify-content:flex-start}.phone,.phone.small-drop,.phone.large-rise{transform:none}}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"stage\" aria-label=\"Three iOS music app screens\">\n    <article class=\"phone small-drop\" aria-label=\"Listen Now screen\">\n      <div class=\"status\"><span>9:41</span><div class=\"sys\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:signal-bold\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wi-fi-router-bold\"></iconify-icon><div class=\"battery\"><span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"island\"></div>\n      <div class=\"safe\">\n        <header class=\"topbar\"><img class=\"profile\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=160&q=85\" alt=\"Profile\"/><button class=\"circle-btn\" aria-label=\"Notifications\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-linear\"></iconify-icon></button></header>\n        <p class=\"caption\">Listen Now</p><h1 class=\"large-title\">Your music,<br>made softer.</h1>\n        <div class=\"search-pill\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\"></iconify-icon><span>Artists, songs, albums</span></div>\n        <section class=\"hero-album subtle-card\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85\" alt=\"Album artwork\"><div class=\"hero-copy\"><div><h2>Evening Bloom</h2><p>Luna Vale · 32 songs</p></div><button class=\"play-btn\" aria-label=\"Play Evening Bloom\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-bold\"></iconify-icon></button></div></section>\n        <div class=\"section-head\"><h3>Made for You</h3><a href=\"#\">See All</a></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><img class=\"cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516280440614-37939bbacd81?auto=format&fit=crop&w=220&q=85\" alt=\"\"><div><div class=\"row-title\">Focus Flow</div><div class=\"row-sub\">Deep beats and warm vocals</div></div><iconify-icon class=\"more\" icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><img class=\"cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493225457124-a3eb161ffa5f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=220&q=85\" alt=\"\"><div><div class=\"row-title\">New Indie Mix</div><div class=\"row-sub\">Updated today</div></div><iconify-icon class=\"more\" icon=\"solar:ellipsis-horizontal-circle-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n      </div>\n      <nav class=\"tabbar\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><a class=\"tab active\" href=\"#\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-2-bold\"></iconify-icon>Home</a><a class=\"tab\" href=\"#\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:music-library-2-linear\"></iconify-icon>Library</a><a class=\"tab\" href=\"#\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radio-linear\"></iconify-icon>Radio</a><a class=\"tab\" href=\"#\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\"></iconify-icon>Search</a></nav><div class=\"home-indicator\"></div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"phone large-rise\" aria-label=\"Now playing screen\">\n      <div class=\"player-bg\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85\" alt=\"\"></div>\n      <div class=\"status\"><span>9:41</span><div class=\"sys\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:signal-bold\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wi-fi-router-bold\"></iconify-icon><div class=\"battery\"><span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"island\"></div>\n      <div class=\"safe\">\n        <header class=\"topbar\"><button class=\"circle-btn\" aria-label=\"Close player\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\"></iconify-icon></button><p class=\"caption\">Now Playing</p><button class=\"circle-btn\" aria-label=\"More options\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-bold\"></iconify-icon></button></header>\n        <div class=\"artwork\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85\" alt=\"Evening Bloom album cover\"></div>\n        <section class=\"track\"><h1>Pink Noise Garden</h1><p>Luna Vale</p></section>\n        <div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-line\"><span></span><i></i></div><div class=\"times\"><span>1:42</span><span>-2:18</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"controls\"><button aria-label=\"Shuffle\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shuffle-linear\"></iconify-icon></button><button aria-label=\"Previous\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rewind-back-bold\"></iconify-icon></button><button class=\"main\" aria-label=\"Pause\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-bold\"></iconify-icon></button><button aria-label=\"Next\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rewind-forward-bold\"></iconify-icon></button><button aria-label=\"Repeat\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:repeat-one-linear\"></iconify-icon></button></div>\n        <div class=\"volume\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:volume-loud-linear\"></iconify-icon><div class=\"volume-line\"><span></span></div><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:airbuds-case-minimalistic-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n      </div><div class=\"home-indicator\"></div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"phone\" aria-label=\"Library screen\">\n      <div class=\"status\"><span>9:41</span><div class=\"sys\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:signal-bold\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wi-fi-router-bold\"></iconify-icon><div class=\"battery\"><span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"island\"></div>\n      <div class=\"safe library-header\">\n        <header class=\"topbar\"><div><p class=\"caption\">Library</p><h1 class=\"large-title\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Recently Added</h1></div><button class=\"circle-btn\" aria-label=\"Add playlist\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-circle-linear\"></iconify-icon></button></header>\n        <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip active\">Albums</span><span class=\"chip\">Playlists</span><span class=\"chip\">Artists</span><span class=\"chip\">Downloaded</span></div>\n        <section class=\"playlist-card\"><h2>Soft Launch</h2><p>24 songs · Designed for evening work</p><div class=\"stack\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516280440614-37939bbacd81?auto=format&fit=crop&w=180&q=85\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493225457124-a3eb161ffa5f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=180&q=85\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=180&q=85\" alt=\"\"></div></section>\n        <div class=\"section-head\"><h3>Albums</h3><a href=\"#\">Edit</a></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><img class=\"cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1520523839897-bd0b52f945a0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=220&q=85\" alt=\"\"><div><div class=\"row-title\">Moon Room</div><div class=\"row-sub\">The North Lines · 2026</div></div><iconify-icon class=\"more\" icon=\"solar:ellipsis-horizontal-circle-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><img class=\"cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516280440614-37939bbacd81?auto=format&fit=crop&w=220&q=85\" alt=\"\"><div><div class=\"row-title\">Velvet Tape</div><div class=\"row-sub\">Milo Ray · 18 songs</div></div><iconify-icon class=\"more\" icon=\"solar:ellipsis-horizontal-circle-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><img class=\"cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493225457124-a3eb161ffa5f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=220&q=85\" alt=\"\"><div><div class=\"row-title\">After Hours Sketches</div><div class=\"row-sub\">Nia Bloom · 12 songs</div></div><iconify-icon class=\"more\" icon=\"solar:ellipsis-horizontal-circle-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mini-player\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=180&q=85\" alt=\"\"><div><div class=\"mini-title\">Pink Noise Garden</div><div class=\"mini-sub\">Luna Vale</div></div><button aria-label=\"Pause\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-bold\"></iconify-icon></button></div>\n      <nav class=\"tabbar\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><a class=\"tab\" href=\"#\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-2-linear\"></iconify-icon>Home</a><a class=\"tab active\" href=\"#\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:music-library-2-bold\"></iconify-icon>Library</a><a class=\"tab\" href=\"#\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radio-linear\"></iconify-icon>Radio</a><a class=\"tab\" href=\"#\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\"></iconify-icon>Search</a></nav><div class=\"home-indicator\"></div>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "creator-course-mobile-screens.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/creator-course-mobile-screens.jpg", "source_name": "creator-course-mobile-screens-DESIGN.md", "views": 60, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T20:05:56.191077+00:00"}